### Description (*)
This PR is a follow up of the following [discussion](https://github.com/magento/partners-magento2ee/pull/248#issuecomment-650321192), that is supposed to introduce a new Query, that will return the customer wishlists.
For `CE` version, it will always return a single wishlist (as there is no possibility to create more wishlists), so probably it doesn't make sense to implement any kind of logic to limit it to just 1 result. What do you think?

